MKDIR
=====

Create new directory.


BASIC
-----
mkdir folder

Creates "folder" in current location.


OPTIONS
-------
Create nested folders:
  mkdir -p project/src/components

Multiple folders:
  mkdir folder1 folder2 folder3


WHAT IT DOES
------------
• Creates empty folder
• Sets default permissions
• Ready to use immediately


TIPS
----
Use -p to create parent folders automatically.
Use ls to verify it was created.


ERRORS
------
"file exists"    → Folder already exists
"permission"     → No write access
